  "overview": "You drove a ball 450 yards clear to the green and are face to face with a double eagle opportunity. If only it weren't a dream... Ah... But it doesn't have to be.\n\nValora Valley Golf takes you right smack onto the green; the scent of freshly cut grass, the sounds of chirping birds, the feeling of blood rushing through your veins while your arms start getting the shakes.\n\nValora Valley Golf, put your game to the test.\n\n難攻不落のデビルズコースに、奇蹟のハイパーショットで挑戦！\n\nハイパーショットは全部で4種類。すべてがボール視点だから、迫力満点の超高速3D映像が楽しめます。"
